    "body": "Installed: completed tags now use direct Tag Fadeout Start and Tag Fadeout End distances. Defaults are 182 m and 184 m: full opacity through 182 m, a linear fade from 182-184 m, and no tag at or beyond 184 m. The settings also now read Study Time, Max Tagging Distance (Binos), and Max Tagging Distance (Aiming). Test the fade on a ped or animal near both endpoints; the same curve also applies to horses and plants.",
